                             Power Supply:** An external NPN transistor circuit is provided to regulate the `LDOIN` supply for               
                             the BMS IC, reducing power dissipation within the IC. This circuit is powered from the main `PWR`               
                             rail.\n    18\t\n    19\t# Components Inventory\n    20\t\n    21\t**Integrated Circuits**\n                    
