                             main IC.\n   168\t*   **Resolved:** `TSREF` source is U1 Pin 51.\n   169\t*   **Uncertainty:** The              
                             labels \"BBN_CELL\" and \"BBP_CELL\" in the Bus Bar section appear swapped relative to the port                 
                             symbols. I have assumed the port symbols are correct.\n   170\t*   **Uncertainty:** The exact                   
